@startuml Sequence - Record Creation
title Record Creation Flow (API Documentation)

actor Physician
participant "API Gateway\n(Ingress)" as gateway
participant "Notes-Service" as notes
participant "Appointments-Service" as appointments
database "Notes DB\n(H2)" as notes_db

Physician -> gateway: PUT /records/appointment/{appointmentId}\n{diagnosis, treatment, prescription}
gateway -> notes: Forward to /records/appointment/{appointmentId}
notes -> appointments: GET /appointments/internal/{appointmentId}\n(Header: X-INTERNAL-KEY)
appointments --> notes: Appointment exists
notes -> notes_db: Upsert AppointmentRecord
notes --> gateway: Record updated
gateway --> Physician: Success

note right: API: /records/appointment/{id} (PUT) - Creates/updates medical record.\nValidates appointment via appointments-service.
@enduml
